Helios Voting (helios-server)
  Author: Ben Adida and contributors
  Source: https://github.com/benadida/helios-server
  License: Apache License 2.0

  This project does NOT bundle or redistribute Helios source code. It runs
  as a separate work against a locally-deployed Helios test instance — the
  offensive side models attacks on Helios, and the defensive side (inline
  immune proxy) protects a Helios backend. All references to Helios
  endpoints, views, and documented vulnerabilities are for academic
  security research within the scope of a doctoral dissertation.

